<title>INDIA: INDIA'S CARE WITHDRAWS THE RATING OF KPTL.</title>
<headline>INDIA'S CARE WITHDRAWS THE RATING OF KPTL.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Analysis &amp; Research Ltd.(CARE) said on Thursday in a statement that it has withdrawn the CARE AA-(FD) rating assigned to the Fixed Deposit programme of Kalpataru Power Transmission Limited (KPTL) at the request of the company. The rating was assigned in October 1996. The FD programme of KPTL has been withdrawn and there are no outstanding deposits.</p>
</text>
